  "remarks": "TAi.127 Title: Mullah. Designation: Third Secretary, Taliban Embassy, Islamabad. Afghan passport no. D001206 issued 17 Jul. 2000. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 29 Jul. 2010. Picture available for inclusion in the INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice.; Listing: Listed on 25 Jan. 2001 (amended on 3 Sep. 2003, 25 Jul. 2006, 21 Sep. 2007, 29 Nov. 2011, 7 Sep. 2016)",
